# YouTube Downloader

A Windows desktop application for downloading YouTube videos as MP4 files or extracting audio as MP3.

## Installation

1. Download `AceFazYoutubeDownloaderSetup.exe` from the [Releases page](https://github.com/AceFaz1987/YoutubeDownloader/releases).
2. Run the installer and follow the instructions.
3. Launch YouTube Downloader from the Start Menu or desktop shortcut.

## Features

- Download videos as MP4.
- Extract audio as MP3.
- Choose the output filename and save location.
- Includes the tools required for downloading and processing media.

**Platform:** Windows 10/11, 64-bit
